<iframe class="drillui-frame" src=<<drilluiURL>> frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" allow="clipboard-read; clipboard-write"></iframe>
</$list>
</$list>

<div class="drillui-foot">

<$text text={{{ [<drillui.url>] }}}/> — one frame == one REPL process: `drillui_bridge.ts` spawns it on WebSocket open and kills it on close, so switching route ends the running session. If the panel stays blank, press ''tab ↗'': a real tab shows the error a frame swallows.

</div>
